;;
;; An original work written for Kei (WS095, decision D3): everyday words that
;; REmacs's SKK-JISYO.X lacks or orders for other texts, measured with the 100
;; sentences of plan/ws095/tests/ja-sentences.tsv.  No entry is copied from
;; another dictionary.  DRAFT (ws095-p003): the list is put to the user; the
;; words and their order may change.
;;
;; Headwords follow SKK-JISYO.X (REmacs tools/skkdict/expand.py): a verb or an
;; adjective is its stem's reading and the letter of its first okurigana kana
;; (読む よm, 食べる たb, 分かる わk, 終わる おw); a pure-い adjective has both
;; an i and a k headword with the same word.  Where a word is usually written in
;; kana, the kana come first.
;;
